    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Sep 2022 05:55:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>联合主办</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>moledao </span></strong><span>@moledao_io</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联合主持</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>Coral </span></strong><span>（Ambassador @moledao）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>w3tester（张晓）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>Founder @zCloak Network</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>段少</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>社区经理 @Next.ID</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Chelsea</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>Investment Manager @Foresight Ventures</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Alec杨安然</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>Founder @DID Project</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Phoebe</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>Community Manager @moledao</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容导览】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> &nbsp;w3tester ：我们为什么需要DID（去中心化身份）？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> &nbsp;w3tester ：DID对用户的重要性体现在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> &nbsp;杨安然：比较常见的DID方案？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> &nbsp;段少：DID落地，还在面临哪些障碍？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> &nbsp;Chelsea ：从投资角度看，DID如何走向大众？去获得更广泛的应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> &nbsp;DID中的SBT会以什么形式体现？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> &nbsp;DID与Web3的用户匿名和隐私如何平衡呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3443">57:23</a> &nbsp;DID走向大众被广泛应用的条件是什么？对普通用户的最大价值是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3841">1:04:01</a> DID在国内的合规应用场景？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkLB1KRbgU-lFcDcao3rMzno5Klp.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【联合主办方：MoleDAO】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>MoleDAO是一个区块链社交平台</span></strong><span>，供所有区块链爱好者了解区块链的最新动态，并在经验丰富的区块链先驱者和创新者的帮助下成长，为构建Web 3.0生态系统贡献更多创新想法。旨在通过搭建区块链爱好者交流社区、提供区块链项目支持、举办全球黑客松系列活动、帮助项目人才匹配、提供项目赞助和指导，将区块链理念带给每个人并发展区块链生态系统。</span></p><span></span><p><span>MoleDAO的愿景是成为一个精心策划的一站式区块链生态系统。无论你是区块链爱好者、区块链开发者、机构还是投资者，都可以在Moledao找到适合自己的定位。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主办方：1.435】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1.435Club是一个Web3.0的组织。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们专注于助力成员</span><strong><span>从Web2向Web3的转型、教育、创业孵化、投资对接</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>致力于做更多价值连接的事情，让每个人找到属于自己的Web3机会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Twitter：@1435CLUB</span><br><span>微信公众号搜索关注：1435Crypto</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FifvqJpAMn1bMbWcWwL9F0hqqip3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu_KYgDgPA9YQMeS6QcJrIdw8lx7.png"></p>]]></description>
